From ba68e7975a0bb5110cbfb4e968756bfd9d49be42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: assistant <a@a.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 12:28:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0133: Vendor Upgrades Consolidation

- Fold duplicate gold-cost stat upgrades (Success/Gold/Durability/XP/Loot)
  into their owning Guild Hall facility; retune costGrowth so total cost
  to max lands close to what it cost to grind both sources before.
- Remove weapons_training, armourers_contract, veteran_explorer,
  war_stories, efficient_adventuring.
- Add vendor-themed replacements: Smith's Discount, Bulk Scrapper
  (Blacksmith), Apothecary's Discount (Alchemist), Arcane Discount
  (Enchanter); Enchanted Seal reworked (drops old success bonus, gains
  Black Market discount, keeps Legendary-quest unlock).
- New Modifiers keys: repairDiscount, scrapBonus, consumableDiscount,
  enchantDiscount, blackMarketDiscount -- wired through EquipmentManager,
  InventoryManager, CraftingManager, ShopManager, and every UI display
  site that shows an affected price.
- Split the old shared Vendors restock reroll into three independent
  per-vendor rerolls (Blacksmith/Alchemist/Enchanter), each with its own
  Trade Favor upgrade, cost curve, and daily counter; Enchanter gets a
  manual Black Market reroll for the first time.
- SAVE_VERSION 37 -> 38: refunds gold spent on removed upgrades, splits
  trade_favor's level across the new per-vendor upgrades, migrates
  reroll counters.
- guild-idler-status.md updated.
